   "ocr": "doi:10.1371/journal.pmed.1001393.t006 of #6/12 [26]. In the present study, 75.1% of individuals identified as having AMD had an acuity of 6/12 or greater. Only one other prospective study of AMD in Africa was found in the peer-reviewed literature. A hospital-based study in South Africa that looked specifically at AMD in Africans was published"
  },
